音ミク\n・テーマ/構図：夏/楽しそうな感じのミクちゃんをお願いします。先日は日陰で涼しそうなミクちゃんを描いて頂いたので、今回は日なたなど少し明るめの場所にいると嬉しいです！\n\nテーマや構図等指定しておりますが、楽しそうなミクちゃんであれば基本何でも大丈夫ですので、お好きに描いて頂ければと思います。\nご検討のほどよろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@404sekiraun/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6afd94ad/uploads/origins/e4f1c6cc-8b38-48bb-bcb0-553d561b42c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=792fa08a4890100ea01ad72a50b2ddb0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6afd94ad/uploads/origins/e4f1c6cc-8b38-48bb-bcb0-553d561b42c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=792fa08a4890100ea01ad72a50b2ddb0, https://si.imgix.net/6afd94ad/uploads/origins/e4f1c6cc-8b38-48bb-bcb0-553d561b42c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=47977aba15c708d0126dd9b0d2205ce7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6afd94ad/uploads/origins/e4f1c6cc-8b38-48bb-bcb0-553d561b42c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=27212d3c583658795c0e1e9be812f991 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I would like to request fanart of a vtuber, Sugi Aoki. She's a guildmaster and a bard who loves to sing and go on adventures.\n\nI'll leave the finer details you, but I would like you to include her mascot https://i.imgur.com/NEgTkec.jpeg somewhere in the drawing\n\nreference sheet⮟\nhttps://i.imgur.com/wxEsWi3.jpeg\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@404sekiraun/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a7360f9b/uploads/origins/511e1107-20f9-4220-b00c-2a432d1042ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed23ea1fddb885eaf0b41eb6e5561cc3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a7360f9b/uploads/origins/511e1107-20f9-4220-b00c-2a432d1042ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed23ea1fddb885eaf0b41eb6e5561cc3, https://si.imgix.net/a736